{
  "uid": "sre-lab-dr",
  "title": "SRE Lab / Disaster Recovery (RPO & RTO)",
  "tags": [
    "sre-lab",
    "dr"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "RPO = how much data we can lose (backup freshness). RTO = how long recovery takes (pods Ready again). Phase 9.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "name": "DR drill events",
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "tags": [
            "dr-drill"
          ],
          "limit": 50,
          "matchAny": true
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Current RPO exposure (age of last successful backup)",
      "description": "If the database were lost NOW, orders placed in this window would be lost. Target: < 15 min (backup every 15 min).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max(kube_cronjob_status_last_successful_time{namespace=\"backups\",cronjob=\"pg-backup\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 900
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1200
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Drill results",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### DR drill: 2026-09-26, `kubectl delete namespace astronomy-shop`\n| | Target | **Actual** |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Stateless RTO** (Argo CD rebuild from Git) | 10 min | **136 s** \u2705 |\n| **Total RTO** (+ Postgres restore) | 15 min | **142 s** \u2705 |\n| **RPO** (orders lost) | \u2264 15 min | **1 order** (placed 28 s after the last backup) \u2705 |\n| Without the backup | \u2014 | **1,723 orders lost** |\n\nTimeline (dashed markers): backup 18:08:38 \u00b7 disaster 18:09:06 \u00b7 namespace recreated 18:10:04 \u00b7 stateless recovered 18:11:22 \u00b7 DB restored 18:11:29.\nGuide: `docs/labs/phase-9-dr-prr.md`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Backups succeeded (jobs kept)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_job_status_succeeded{namespace=\"backups\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RTO: shop pods Ready",
      "description": "The dip is the outage; the time back to the full count is the stateless RTO. Dashed markers = drill events.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"astronomy-shop\",condition=\"true\"})",
          "legendFormat": "pods Ready",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(kube_pod_info{namespace=\"astronomy-shop\"})",
          "legendFormat": "pods existing",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "User impact: checkout responses by HTTP status (per 2 min)",
      "description": "Gaps = no data (the shop's own telemetry was deleted with it).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (increase(traces_span_metrics_calls_total{service_name=\"frontend\",span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\",span_name=\"POST /api/checkout\",http_response_status_code!=\"\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": null
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RPO: backup freshness over time",
      "description": "Saw-tooth: resets at each successful backup. Crossing the dashed line = RPO target at risk.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max(kube_cronjob_status_last_successful_time{namespace=\"backups\",cronjob=\"pg-backup\"})",
          "legendFormat": "seconds since last backup",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 900
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}